        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sufe Bradshaw, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Armando Iannucci\n- Television series: Veep, The Thick of It\n- Companies: HBO\n- Roles: Sue, Selina Meyer\n\nFacts:\n- Sufe Bradshaw was born on April 16, 1986.\n- Veep premiered on HBO on April 22, 2012.\n- Veep is an American political satire comedy television series starring Julia Louis-Dreyfus.\n- Veep was created by Armando Iannucci as an adaptation of the British sitcom The Thick of It.\n- Sufe Bradshaw is an American actress.\n- Sufe Bradshaw is best known for playing Sue, the acerbic secretary and scheduler to Vice-President Selina Meyer, in the HBO comedy series Veep.",
